(7716757, 1268812, 77196, '<td valign="top">FWIW: Photo has strong, harsh shadows, including one in the bottom left; Maybe change perspective so man appears to be between laundry and building rather than "almost centered" on the round building; maybe have man took at camera (depending on what you''re trying to depict). Maybe a bit better use of the rule of thirds - man could be at left 1/3 for example. 

<br/>I like the pops of color in the background, the open framework against the sky, the primarily earth "fields" - making it look like the crop is struggling to survive; the man''s dirty legs and feet.</td>', 'FWIW: Photo has strong, harsh shadows, including one in the bottom left; Maybe change perspective so man appears to be between laundry and building rather than "almost centered" on the round building; maybe have man took at camera (depending on what you''re trying to depict). Maybe a bit better use of the rule of thirds - man could be at left 1/3 for example. 

I like the pops of color in the background, the open framework against the sky, the primarily earth "fields" - making it look like the crop is struggling to survive; the man''s dirty legs and feet.', '2022-03-15 11:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
